--- veraflow 2
{
  title: "Dispatch report",
  workflow: "form",
  filename: "Dispatch-{{field.reference}}",
  "verify-by-default": false,
  fields: {
    reference: {type: "text"},
    contact: {type: "text"},
    destination: {type: "text"},
    packages: {type: "text"},
    priority: {type: "text", optional: true},
    notes: {type: "textarea", optional: true},
    tracking: {type: "text", optional: true},
  },
}
---
---
mainfont: Arial Unicode MS
mainfontoptions: [AutoFakeBold=2]
---

# Dispatch {{reference}}

- **Destination** {{destination}}
- **Contact** {{contact}}
- **Packages** {{packages}}

{{notes}}
